# the phi's value is stored somewhere the function owns: a stack frame it
# reserved, or (a leaf, since 2026-10-09) its direct-page frame — never a
# stack offset without a frame, which was the return address
in both: present sbc\.w #\d+\n\ttas|sta\.b tcc__lf\+\d+
in both: absent sta \d+,s
# fully folded: nothing is stored at all
in either: absent sta \d+,s
